6. Security note  —  backend/ml/models/feature_scaler.pkl
================================================================================

This file is a Python pickle. Deserializing a pickle executes arbitrary code.
It is loaded at runtime by backend/app/services/activity_classifier.py.

If you did not obtain this repository from its original author, inspect or
regenerate this file before running the application. It can be regenerated by
re-running backend/ml/training/train_lstm_v5.py.

